Stage1
/ a missing decider key is asked once, saved, never shown; the next build asks nothing — C# test MissingDeciderKeyTests
/ (AMissingKey_IsAskedOnce_Saved_AndNeverShown)
/ with no one to ask, the build fails naming %!llm.decider.setting.key% and TYPESAFE_API_KEY, and no request reaches
/ the service — C# test MissingDeciderKeyTests (NoOneToAsk_FailsNamingBothWays_AndSendsNothing)
/ a saved key, or the environment's, is used without asking — C# test MissingDeciderKeyTests (AHeldKey_IsNotAsked)
